# Lennard-Jones reduced units. A harmonic bond relaxes from length 1.4 to 1.
units lj
atom_style bond
boundary f f f
region cell block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 1 cell bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/special/per/atom 4
create_atoms 1 single 2.0 3.0 3.0
create_atoms 1 single 3.4 3.0 3.0
mass 1 1.0
pair_style zero 2.5
pair_coeff * *
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 50.0 1.0
create_bonds single/bond 1 1 2
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms ebond pe fmax
min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-12 1.0e-10 200 2000
write_dump all custom relaxed.lammpstrj id type x y z modify sort id
